    routePath: 'spar',
    LLM: 'Game: Spar. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "Spar (or 'Spa') is a trick-taking card game widely played in Ghana and other parts of West Africa (sometimes as 'Sipa'). It is typically played with 2-4 players (solo or partnerships). The core mechanic revolves around taking the last trick, which earns significant points, and collecting certain cards (Aces, 10s). The game is fast, social, and often played for small stakes. It uses a reduced 32 or 36 card deck.",
    tagline: "Spar (or 'Spa') is a trick-taking card game widely played in Ghana and other par...",
